        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BBS2001L, Sobe Solid Brass \"L\" Toilet Paper Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDepending on the the finish, the \"L\" Shaped Toilet Paper Holder toilet paper roll holder will look great in both traditional and contemporary decors. Made with the quality that Deltana is known for, this Sobe Series Toilet Tissue Holder is constructed out of solid brass.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBS2001L-specifications.gif?v=1704354761\" width=\"473\" height=\"322\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BBS2001L Toilet Paper Holder Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana BBS Sobe Series\"><b>Deltana Sobe Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Sobe Toilet Paper Roll Holder:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Arm Length: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Reversible to hang in either direction.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting for a clean, contemporary look.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBS2001L.pdf?v=1691095349\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BBS2001L Toilet Paper Holder Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 toilet tissue holder, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "L Shaped Sobe Toilet Tissue Holder, Deltana BBS2001L",
                "description": "Deltana BSS2001L Sobe Solid Brass L Toilet Paper Holder - Depending on the the finish, the L Shaped Toilet Paper Holder toilet paper roll holder will look great in both traditional and contemporary decors; is is available in oil rubbed bronze, polished chrome, polished nickel, satin brass and satin nickel finishes. Made with the quality that Deltana is known for, this Sobe Series Toilet Tissue Holder is constructed out of solid brass.",
